<title>UK: Dalgety at four-month low on broker comment.</title>
<headline>Dalgety at four-month low on broker comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in food manufacturer Dalgety Plc dropped on Friday as analysts at Dresdner Kleinwort Benson repeated a &quot;sell&quot; rating on the stock and SBC Warburg trimmed earnings estimates, dealers said.</p>
<p>Dalgety shares were down 6-1/2p at 318-1/2 by 0958 GMT after earlier falling as low as 317p -- their lowest since early last December. Volume was a moderate 811,009 shares.</p>
</text>
